The method underneath it is [semantic SEO](/services/semantic-seo/): building [topical authority](/services/topical-authority/) through entity relationships, comprehensive coverage, and structured content that generative engines can extract cleanly. GEO and AEO are integrated into every engagement from day one rather than sold as an upsell, because generative-engine visibility comes from the same entity and content foundations as strong organic rankings. This suits SMEs, B2B, SaaS, professional services, and healthcare firms, particularly in regulated or YMYL niches where source credibility decides whether a generative engine cites you. Reading is 25 minutes from London Paddington, with in-person meetings available across London, the Thames Valley, and the South East.

