Most agencies on this list do not publish a GEO rate card; pricing is quoted per client, or delivered inside a wider SEO retainer. The bands below reflect the general UK market for GEO-inclusive SEO work, with published figures marked as such.

| Tier | Typical monthly range | Example |
|------|----------------------|---------|
| Independent specialist | From £1,200/mo | Sunny Patel SEO (published) |
| Boutique / specialist AI search | Day rate, or roughly £1,500-£2,500/mo | Screaming Frog (day rate, published); Semetrical (custom quote, not published) |
| Mid-market agency | Roughly £2,000-£5,000/mo | Impression Digital, Aira, Distinctly, Passion Digital, Add People, Hallam (not published; band is a market estimate) |
| Enterprise / full-service | £5,000/mo+ | Rise at Seven, Builtvisible (not published; band is a market estimate) |

Be cautious of a provider charging an enterprise rate for "GEO" as a bolt-on with no documented AI citations attached. Genuine GEO companies build it into the same content and entity strategy as the rest of the retainer, rather than pricing it as a separate premium line item.

